==Description==
'''The Final Act Event''' is the twenty-fifth event to be added to Tower Defense Simulator. The event began on the 20th of December 2025 and ended on the 11th of March 2026. Its battle pass ended on the 9th of February 2026.

==The Final Act Battle Pass==
[[File:TheFinalActPass.png|450px|thumb|center]]
'''The Final Act Battle Pass''' used {{PlushieSnowman|Plushie Snowmen}} as its currency, in which enemies dropped between one and three currency on death by walking near them. These currency drops did not give one {{PlushieSnowman|Plushie Snowman}} each. The number varied based on the mode played.

