While the battle pass did have a set amount for [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] mode, that being {{PlushieSnowman|800}}, which, when divided by total waves, would make it give {{PlushieSnowman|16}} per wave, this did not work in the mode and instead gave nothing.

In total, it took {{PlushieSnowman|27,005}} to complete the battle pass. The battle pass had two tracks: the regular track that could be obtained for free and the premium track, which was purchasable for {{Robux|319}}.

