==Trivia==
*Beating [[The Narratorium]] gave players the Narrator Noli skin in Forsaken as part of a collab with the game.
**Because of this collab, the event was extended by a few weeks to give players more to get the skin.
*'''The Final Act Event''' was originally supposed to end on 2nd of March 2026. However, this did not happen and instead the event ended 9 days later than expected.
*The [[Showtime Crate]] was released in conjunction with '''The Final Act Event''', was obtainable as a triumph reward by beating Hard difficulty in [[The Narratorium]], and was supposed to become unobtainable once '''The Final Act Event''' had concluded.
**However, this never occurred and the crate was instead made permanent.

